{
  "notes": {
    "about": "Expected leg D findings per case, written by schema_check.py --update-expected. A VOCAB finding on PowerIO output enters this file only with a note below saying why it is accepted; PROFILE findings are warnings and are recorded as observed. Corpus cases are kept when the corpus is absent.",
    "VOCAB.PROPERTY_UNKNOWN ShuntCompensatorPhase.bPerSection / gPerSection (micro_feeder.xml source)": "The hand-written fixture uses the non-standard ShuntCompensatorPhase.* spelling, which the reader accepts as a fallback; cim17v40 declares bPerSection and gPerSection on LinearShuntCompensatorPhase, which the writer emits. Candidate fixture fix in a later PR.",
    "VOCAB.CLASS_UNKNOWN PhotovoltaicUnit, VOCAB.REFERENCE_TYPE ... -> PhotovoltaicUnit (Powergrid-Models sources)": "Upstream spelling: cim17v40 names the class PhotoVoltaicUnit.",
    "VOCAB.ENUM_VALUE BatteryUnit.batteryState = BatteryState.* (Powergrid-Models sources)": "Upstream: cim17v40 declares the enumeration BatteryStateKind with lower case members (charging, discharging, ...).",
    "VOCAB.PROPERTY_UNKNOWN SynchronousMachine.p / q / ratedS / ratedU (9500 node source)": "Upstream: cim17v40 declares p and q on RotatingMachine and ratedS and ratedU on RotatingMachine, so the qualified names are RotatingMachine.*.",
    "VOCAB.PROPERTY_UNKNOWN RegulatingControl.discrete, ConnectivityNode.OperationalLimitSet (Powergrid-Models sources)": "Upstream: neither property is declared in cim17v40 (both appear in older CIM16 or GridAPPS-D usage).",
    "PROFILE.PROPERTY_OUTSIDE Terminal.phases, PowerTransformerEnd.x (PowerIO output)": "The rc4_2021 profile leaves out Terminal.phases and the PowerTransformerEnd series impedance (GridAPPS-D uses per-phase classes and TransformerMeshImpedance); both are valid cim17v40.",
    "CONVERT.REFUSED BUILD.DIST.ELECTRICAL_INCOMPLETE (IEEE13_Assets, 9500 node)": "Segments described by wire spacing and wire data have no impedance the reader can use yet (wire geometry follow-up).",
    "CONVERT.REFUSED PARSE.CLI.ERRORS_REPORTED (bmopf/example_enwl_n1_f2.json)": "The CLI refuses to convert a case whose reader reported errors; the Rust stable-CIM test writes it through the library instead.",
    "PROFILE.PROPERTY_OUTSIDE Asset.PowerSystemResources (tank output)": "The rc4_2021 profile omits this valid cim17v40 association. Eight Assets link the synthetic fixture tanks to their catalogs; no vocabulary errors are accepted."
  },
